# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the value below.
# .env.local is gitignored — never commit real credentials.

# Formspree endpoint for the contact form.
#
# To get it:
#   1. Sign up at https://formspree.io
#   2. Create a new form, set the notification email to info@uniformedge.co.in
#   3. Formspree shows an endpoint like https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz
#   4. Paste that full URL below
#
# This value is public by design — it is called from the browser and is not a
# secret. It still must be set in Vercel's Environment Variables for production,
# not only in .env.local, or the live form will refuse to submit.
#
# If this is unset, the form does NOT silently fail: it shows an error pointing
# the visitor at WhatsApp, phone and email instead.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=
